5:18-5:23 error dot_property_access: SSL uses colon ':' for property access, not dot '.'. Use 'object:Name' instead of 'object.Name'
6:17-6:22 error dot_property_access: SSL uses colon ':' for property access, not dot '.'. Use 'object:Year' instead of 'object.Year'
